+### Transferring a user to another organization
+
+- Only an org admin of the user's current organization may transfer; the
+  organization in the path must be the actor's own (else 404), non-admins get 403.
+- The user must belong to `{oid}` (else 404). The destination must exist and
+  differ from the current organization (else 400).
+- To keep "project members belong to the project's organization", the transfer
+  removes the user's project memberships and unassigns their tasks. Org admin
+  rights do not carry over. All of it is one transaction.
+
